### 1. 心跳检测
GET http://localhost:8080/ping

### 2. 数据库全部用户列表（开发阶段调试）
GET http://localhost:8080/test/users

### 3. 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "coder_jack",
  "displayName": "杰克",
  "email": "jack@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. 用户登录（获取 AccessToken，响应头下发 httpOnly Cookie）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "coder_jack",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {%
    // IntelliJ IDEA 官方规范：将响应中的 accessToken 保存到全局变量，后续请求直接引用 {{accessToken}}
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.log(">>> [已自动保存 accessToken]: " + response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 5. 受保护端点：获取当前用户个人信息（必须带 Bearer Token）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. 受保护端点：无 Token 访问（测试鉴权拦截，预期 401 Unauthorized）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me

### 7. 刷新 Token（依赖 Cookie 中的 Refresh Token）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.log(">>> [刷新成功，已更新 accessToken]: " + response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 8. 退出登录（吊销 Refresh Token 并清空 Cookie）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout

### ===================================================
### 群组与知识库管理（Group 模块测试流）
### ===================================================

### 9. 创建群组 / 知识库（自动将当前用户设为 OWNER）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "技术架构知识库",
  "description": "存放微服务、RAG 与系统设计文档"
}

> {%
    // 保存新建群组 ID 到全局变量，后续请求直接引用 {{groupId}}
    client.global.set("groupId", response.body.data);
    client.log(">>> [已自动保存 groupId]: " + response.body.data);
%}

### 10. 查询当前用户可见的所有群组（包含我拥有的、加入的、待处理邀请）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/my
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    if (response.body.data.ownedGroups && response.body.data.ownedGroups.length > 0) {
        client.global.set("groupCode", response.body.data.ownedGroups[0].groupCode);
        client.log(">>> [已自动保存 groupCode]: " + response.body.data.ownedGroups[0].groupCode);
    }
%}

### 11. 查询指定群组的成员列表（仅 OWNER 或成员可查）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{groupId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. 创建群组邀请（仅群主 OWNER 可发起，邀请用户 ID: 1）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{groupId}}/invitations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "inviteeUserId": 1
}

> {%
    client.global.set("invitationId", response.body.data);
    client.log(">>> [已自动保存 invitationId]: " + response.body.data);
%}

### 13. 查询当前用户发出的所有群组邀请
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/invitations/my-sent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. 接受群组邀请（需使用被邀请人的 Token）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invitations/{{invitationId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. 拒绝群组邀请（需使用被邀请人的 Token）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invitations/{{invitationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16. 取消群组邀请（仅群主 OWNER 可操作）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invitations/{{invitationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17. 提交加入群组申请（用户凭群编码 groupCode 申请加入）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups/join-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "groupCode": "{{groupCode}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("requestId", response.body.data);
    client.log(">>> [已自动保存 requestId]: " + response.body.data);
%}

### 18. 查询当前用户提交的所有加入申请
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/join-requests/my
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19. 群主查询指定群组待审批的加入申请列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{groupId}}/join-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 20. 群主审批通过加入申请
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{groupId}}/join-requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 21. 群主拒绝加入申请
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{groupId}}/join-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 22. 退出群组（普通成员退群，OWNER 不能退）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{groupId}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###############################################################################
# 四、文档管理模块 (Documents API)
###############################################################################

### 23. 直接上传文档 (文件 <= 10MB, 支持 txt, md, pdf, docx)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="groupId"

{{groupId}}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello LeanArgus! This is a test document for RAG ingestion and object storage.
--WebAppBoundary--

> {%
    client.global.set("documentId", response.body.data);
    client.log(">>> [已自动保存 documentId]: " + response.body.data);
%}

### 24. 初始化分片上传会话 (支持秒传 / 断点续传 / 新建会话)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents/upload/init
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{groupId}},
  "fileName": "large_report.txt",
  "fileSize": 1048576,
  "fileHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
  "chunkSize": 524288,
  "chunkCount": 2
}

> {%
    if (response.body.data && response.body.data.uploadId) {
        client.global.set("uploadId", response.body.data.uploadId);
        client.log(">>> [已自动保存 uploadId]: " + response.body.data.uploadId);
    }
%}

### 25. 上传分片 0
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents/upload/chunks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploadId"

{{uploadId}}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunkIndex"

0
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunkHash"

1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="chunk_0.part"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./scratch/test_chunk_0.part
--WebAppBoundary--

### 26. 查询分片上传会话进度
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents/upload/{{uploadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 27. 完成分片合并 (校验全部分片并在 MinIO 合并生成 Document)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents/upload/{{uploadId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 28. 查询文档列表 (支持按群组、文件名、状态过滤)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents?groupId={{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 29. 预览文档文本内容 (仅限 READY 状态文档，从 MinIO 读取并解析返回)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents/{{documentId}}/preview?groupId={{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 30. 下载文档原始文件 (流式传输，Content-Disposition: attachment)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents/{{documentId}}/download?groupId={{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 31. 重新处理失败文档 (重试 ETL 处理流程)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents/{{documentId}}/retry-ingestion?groupId={{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 32. 软删除文档 (级联清理向量存储及全文检索索引)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/documents/{{documentId}}?groupId={{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

